{"id": "unknown-2026-06-28-004", "date": "2026-06-28", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 26, "weekday": "Sun"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["fast_fashion"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "3 EU states seeks sterner ultra-fast fashion rules at environment body", "content": "Germany, France and the Netherlands are advocating coordinated European action against ultra-fast fashion. \nThey raised the topic recently at the EU Environment Council in Luxembourg, and called on the European Commission to make existing and planned EU provisions more effective against short-lived, low quality textiles. \nGermany favours stringent provisions for textiles under the EU Ecodesign Regulation. ", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_apparel", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/apparel-news/3-eu-states-seeks-sterner-ultra-fast-fashion-rules-at-environment-body-311290-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "nike-2026-06-28-005", "date": "2026-06-28", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 26, "weekday": "Sun"}, "entities": {"companies": ["nike"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": [], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.5, "keywords": ["growth"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Nike appoints David Denton as executive VP and CFO", "content": "Nike has named David M. Denton as executive vice president and chief financial officer (CFO), effective August 17, succeeding Matthew Friend.\nDenton joins from Pfizer and brings over three decades of finance leadership experience across major global companies.\nThe move supports Nike’s focus on disciplined execution, capital allocation and long-term growth under its Sport Offense strategy.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_apparel", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/apparel-news/nike-appoints-david-denton-as-executive-vp-and-cfo-311203-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
